<title>USA: Pratt says laid off 200 in Conn., Florida.</title>
<headline>Pratt says laid off 200 in Conn., Florida.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp unit Pratt &amp; Whitney said on Friday it laid off more than 200 salaried employees earlier this week in Connecticut and Florida.</p>
<p>The layoffs were evenly split between the two states, Pratt spokesman Larry Churchill told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We will be always looking at our workforce requirements, so we do probably anticipate some further reductions,&quot; Churchill said. He did not elaborate.  </p>
<p>Pratt has more than 12,000 employees in Connecticut.</p>
<p>--Hartford newsroom (860) 727-0224 ))</p>
